## Phase 1 - Shared metadata and descriptor catalog

Depends on: Phase 0.

Goal: give descriptor metadata, skill taxonomy, and enum traversal one source
of truth, then stop rebuilding descriptors during searches.

Status: in progress — implementation, automated validation, and a live
DFHack catalog query are complete; the visual in-game picker comparison remains
pending with the Phase 0 interactive smoke run.

Live validation (DF/DFHack 0.53.15): one stable catalog contained 149 skills,
6 physical attributes, 13 mental attributes, and 50 traits (218 indexed
descriptors total). The development taxonomy query identified 54 current skill
keys using the explicit `Other Skills` fallback without emitting normal runtime
output.

