☐ Verify tooltips for controls, filter actions, and stats headers.
☐ Verify window drag and resize at default and minimum supported sizes.
☐ Verify section dividers, panel edges, padding, underlines, CP437 glyphs, and
  action widths match the Phase 0 baseline.
☐ Verify refresh repopulates residents and zoom uses the resident's live
  position.
☐ Close and reopen the window and verify filter order/directions persist.

### Closure

☐ Record final automated and in-game validation results in the implementation
  handoff or commit notes.
